# Build context for gfx803/Dockerfile is this directory. Only patches/ is ever
# COPYed from it; everything else here is documentation, host-side tooling, or
# the whole separate rocm7/ build tree (which has its own context and its own
# .dockerignore), and would otherwise be hashed and shipped to the daemon on
# every build. Same reasoning as the repo-root .dockerignore.
#
# This does not affect layer caching: BuildKit keys a COPY on the checksums of
# the files it actually copies, not on the whole context.
*.md
*.py
tools/
rocm7/
